        <gr str="3605">all </gr>his <gr str="6887">enemies</gr>, he <gr str="6315">puffeth </gr>at them. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="6"> He hath <gr str="559">said </gr>in his <gr str="3820">heart</gr>, I shall <gr str="1077">not </gr>be <gr str="4131">moved</gr>: for <STYLE css="color:#808080;font-style:italic"> I </STYLE>
