        <gr str="5999">mischief </gr>and <gr str="205">vanity</gr>. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="8"> He <gr str="3427">sitteth </gr>in the lurking <gr str="3993">places </gr>of the <gr str="2691">villages</gr>: in the secret <gr str="4565">places </gr>doth he <gr str="2026">murder </gr>the <gr str="5355">innocent</gr>: his <gr str="5869">eyes </gr>are privily <gr str="6845">set </gr>against the <gr str="2489">poor</gr>. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="9"> He lieth in <gr str="693">wait </gr>
