      <VERS vnumber="11"> He hath <gr str="559">said </gr>in his <gr str="3820">heart</gr>, <gr str="410">God </gr>hath <gr str="7911">forgotten</gr>: he <gr str="5641">hideth </gr>his <gr str="6440">face</gr>; he will <gr str="1077 5331">never </gr>
